{"id":"641162","name":"板栗香芋卤肉盖饭","author":"🌽寶寶🍎媽咪🥕","authorId":"12858278","desc":"","cover":"images/641162/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅頭肉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"板栗","amount":"適量（用椎栗比較好吃）"},{"name":"香芋","amount":"適量"},{"name":"紅蘿蔔","amount":"適量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料準備好。","img":"images/641162/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"椎栗和芋頭先蒸熟，芋頭切小丁備用。","img":"images/641162/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"梅頭肉切小塊。","img":"images/641162/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜頭切碎，蔥白切小段。","img":"images/641162/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"紅蘿蔔切小丁。","img":"images/641162/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下油爆香蒜蓉蔥頭。","img":"images/641162/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下梅頭肉丁炒香。","img":"images/641162/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入紅蘿蔔丁炒至均勻。","img":"images/641162/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入調味料。","img":"images/641162/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再加入水和板栗中小火炆煮20分鐘。","img":"images/641162/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"椎栗鹵至入味后。","img":"images/641162/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入香芋再蚊煮10分鐘至收汁。","img":"images/641162/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"灑上蔥花香噴噴的，上飯啦🍚","img":"images/641162/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"蓋上米飯🍚～干飯啦😋🤤🤤","img":"images/641162/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"栗子用椎栗比較香糯好吃😋\n建議鹵汁不要收太乾🤭用來撈飯越美味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}